    "heading": "What {replies} replies a month cost",
    "intro": "The table counts {charged} charged messages after the {free} free ones, from one number, Meta's fee only. Twilio adds $0.005 per message sent or received, on top of Meta's fee, so a reply to a user's message costs $0.01 in Twilio fees: $0.005 for the user's message and $0.005 for the reply. For the table's 10,000 replies, answering 10,000 user messages, Twilio's fees add $100. Twilio also charges $0.001 per failed message.",
